{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I have always had an idea to adapt MIDI music into a game, so I started learning how to program and make games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So I incorporated some elements of music performance into the fighting game, such as music skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At present, the early access has all the features I want in this game, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. There are various rhythm patterns in the music, as well as special split beat rhythms. Such as SWING, triplets, sixteenth notes, dotted notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. The rhythm patterns of drums and light and heavy rhythms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following content will be updated in the official version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Characters with various music combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. MIDI music can be imported and directly converted into levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Players create a motive and develop it into a complete genre of music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Imitate the works of music masters for imitation creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Improvise interesting themes with different modes and rhythm patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Group name:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">String Theory Exchange Group</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Group number:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">374813001</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1129760?t=1743591132","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743591132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129760/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743591132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129760/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743591132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I have always had an idea to adapt MIDI music into a game, so I started learning how to program and make games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So I incorporated some elements of music performance into the fighting game, such as music skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At present, the early access has all the features I want in this game, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. There are various rhythm patterns in the music, as well as special split beat rhythms. Such as SWING, triplets, sixteenth notes, dotted notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. The rhythm patterns of drums and light and heavy rhythms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following content will be updated in the official version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Characters with various music combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. MIDI music can be imported and directly converted into levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Players create a motive and develop it into a complete genre of music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Imitate the works of music masters for imitation creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Improvise interesting themes with different modes and rhythm patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Group name:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">String Theory Exchange Group</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Group number:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">374813001</p>","developers":["ZHANGHAILONG"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129760/82a54be6a3ffce657999ca22b17f7a95686e5918/header.jpg?t=1743591132","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256932496,"mp